<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and sterling.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens on dollar and sterling.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was fixed weaker against the dollar and pound on Friday, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 20.5895 against the dollar from 20.5570 on Thursday. The rupee traded at a mean of 32.0205 for one pound from 31.9610 on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Mike Chung, Port Louis ++230 212-6870.</p>
</text>
